WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
A small wooden stool by a fire.

2
00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:04.760
A crutch leans against it.

3
00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:07.900
Its owner hardly speaks in the whole book.

4
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.130
A line here.

5
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.540
Another there.

6
00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:15.690
Yet the very last line is his:
"God bless Us, Every One!"

7
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.980
So why hand the final word
to a boy who barely speaks?

8
00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:22.570
In this mission, you'll
meet the Cratchits:

9
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.110
a poor family, but a warm one.

10
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:27.810
You'll see their poverty shown, not told,

11
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:31.360
right down to "a custard-cup
without a handle".

12
00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.210
And you'll hear a ghost's warning: Tim's
life hangs on whether "these shadows"

13
00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.400
change.

14
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:42.050
Your mission: explain why the
book ends on Tiny Tim's words.
